===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An extensive area of relatively flat [[grassland]] with few, if any, trees, especially in [[North America]].
#*{{quote-book|year=1879|author={{w|Richard Jefferies}}|title=[http://gutenberg.org/ebooks/13730 The Amateur Poacher]|chapter=1
|passage=As one sat on the sward behind the elm, with the back turned on the rick and nothing in front but the tall elms and the oaks in the other hedge, it was quite easy to fancy it the verge of the '''prairie''' with the backwoods close by.}}

